# TC-005: Pressure shifts the boiling plateau under the same heat input
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 20g @ 25C
regulate v1 1bar 100mL
new
add v2 water 20g @ 25C
regulate v2 2bar 100mL
heat v1 8kJ
heat v2 8kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
measure v1 boiling_point
measure v2 boiling_point
inspect
